WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.747
You now have a strong set of tools for writing complex analytical queries in a clear way.

00:00:05.747 --> 00:00:14.362
In Module 12, we will ask a new question: what happens when useful S Q L logic needs to be reused by many reports

00:00:14.362 --> 00:00:15.727
or analysts?

00:00:16.186 --> 00:00:20.509
We will work with views and other reusable database objects.

00:00:20.509 --> 00:00:24.339
The habits from this module will continue to matter.

00:00:24.339 --> 00:00:31.749
A reusable object still needs a clear grain, understandable logic, and predictable behavior.

00:00:31.749 --> 00:00:39.859
So as you move forward, keep the same principle: make the logic powerful, but also make it easy for another person to

00:00:39.859 --> 00:00:41.185
understand.
